}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [382.8311462402344, 152.77996826171875], "pos": [5768.2099609375, 4367.90673828125], "widgets_values": ["\n\n色彩方面（强调低饱和度、干净清爽）：\n\n\"low saturation color palette, desaturated hues,\" (低饱和度色彩，去饱和色调)\n\n\"clean pastel tones,\" (干净的马卡龙色调)\n\n\"muted color scheme,\" (柔和的配色方案)\n\n\"crisp whites and soft greys,\" (清爽的白色和柔和的灰色)\n\n\"light and airy color grading,\" (明亮通透的色彩分级)\n\n氛围与光线（强调明亮、干净）：\n\n\"high key lighting,\" (高调光照)\n\n\"soft diffused light,\" (柔和散射光)\n\n\"clean shadows,\" (干净的阴影)\n\n\"bright daylight,\" (明亮的日光)\n\n\"airy atmosphere,\" (通透的氛围)\n\n设计感与线条感（应用于物体或背景，如果适用）：\n\n\"designed architectural elements,\" (有设计感的建筑元素)\n\n\"sleek and modern accessories,\" (时尚现代的配件)\n\n\"geometric patterns, strong linear design,\" (几何图案，强烈的线条设计)\n\n\"well-defined lines and shapes,\" (轮廓分明的线条和形状)\n\n\"sophisticated craftsmanship,\" (精致的工艺)"], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 2993, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2038, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 3017, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [297.5191650390625, 393.0854797363281], "pos": [5314.1923828125, 3134.943115234375], "id": 2066, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 48}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": [[{"name": "A", "selecte